Package: droidspaces-msm-vaapi
Version: 0.2.4
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: George-Seven <uploadtodrive707@gmail.com>
Depends: libc6, libva2, libva-drm2, libgbm1, python3
Description: Qualcomm msm_vidc VA-API driver and browser launchers
 Hardware video decoding and encoding through Qualcomm msm_vidc V4L2
 interfaces, with AV1 and HEVC Main10 enabled. Installs a Chrome launcher
 that configures Wayland VA-API playback and WebCodecs H.264 encoding, and a
 native Firefox 160 launcher with X11 EGL playback and RDD compatibility.
 Includes a helper to configure a native Jellyfin systemd service for VA-API.
